Package: triforce-backend
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, systemd, redis-server
Recommends: docker.io
Description: AILinux TriForce Multi-LLM Backend source bundle
 TriForce is a FastAPI-based multi-LLM orchestration backend supporting
 hundreds of AI models, MCP tools, federation and persistent memory.
 This package installs the audited application source under /opt/triforce,
 maintains an isolated virtualenv there, and keeps mutable runtime state in
 /var/lib/triforce and /var/log/triforce.
